ext","value":" （"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"为OG与x轴负方向夹角），圆心O与环面分别通过电刷E、F与阻值为r的电阻R相连，其它电阻均不计。在外力作用下，圆环以角速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"绕O点沿顺时针方向匀速转动。以OA进入磁场开始计时，则下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b12dfa446c965d42ba822d2e889b93b580b79e34f61f9a455433662d9ad0c0fd.png","width":324,"height":348,"width_mm":37.954,"row_group":"hangzhou-ermo-2504-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 通过电阻R的电流方向始终为N"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rightarrow"},{"type":"text","value":"M"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 当 OA 棒转动至 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 4 5 ^ { \\circ }"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，感应电动势 "},{"type":"math","value":"e = \\frac{1}{2}B_{0}\\omega L^{2}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 圆环转动一周的过程中，感应电动势有效值为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{rms}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}B_0\\omega L^2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 圆环转动一周的过程中，外力做的功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W=\\frac{\\pi\\omega B_0^2L^4}{5r}"}]],"answer":{"status":"not_ingested","key":null,"body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--hangzhou-ermo-2504-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--hangzhou-ermo-2504","source_question_id":"hangzhou-ermo-2504-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"not_ingested","fingerprint":"0d425b7d4b333485d3b932b62cd6d86a21fc84770c1249bdc6e838da3c94dfdc","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ三题共14分）\n\n14-Ⅰ.（6分）如图1所示是“探究两个互成角度的力的合成规律”实验。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6172cf9f5c17fdd5a52bb8533454e760919f1cdc90f34b8b85d0b69a6b504f72.png","width":339,"height":316,"width_mm":39.705,"row_group":"hangzhou-ermo-2504-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-Ⅰ题图1\n（1）下列仪器中，该实验需要的有（填空）（多选）。A. 弹簧测力计；B. 打点计时器；C. 秒表；D. 刻度尺。\n（2）关于该实验，下列说法正确的是（填空）。A. 同一次实验中结点位置允许变动；B. 应控制两条细线夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"90^\\circ"},{"type":"text","value":"；C. 两根细线应该短一些；D. 一只弹簧测力计也可以完成实验。\n（3）改用如图2所示方案，橡皮筋的上端固定于O点，下端挂一重物M。弹簧测力计通过系在橡皮筋上N处的细线，缓慢水平向左拉。由于橡皮筋弹性发生了变化，发现两次拉动相同水平距离时，N点的轨迹并不重合，如①、②所示。则N分别处于a、b点时弹簧测力计拉力与橡皮筋拉力的合力是否变化？（填空）（填“是”或“否”）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0c0e7ca207b9eae32fe2c324888b74701b0c0fe212328da8e14727806f9332a4.png","width":406,"height":320,"width_mm":47.577,"row_group":"hangzhou-ermo-2504-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-Ⅰ题图2\n\n14-Ⅱ.（3分）做“用单摆测量重力加速度大小”实验时：\n（1）下列装置最佳的是（填空）。\nA. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/dc6be2f92575ef8ebe909c17622bf29f761fa4a392c0bb40860816dfc223f5b1.png","width":200,"height":237,"width_mm":23.398,"row_group":"hangzhou-ermo-2504-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nB. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/687450c079126489aa6c54e5d2140681c8d979c38e64ee2e459356c82ca96003.png","width":171,"height":262,"width_mm":20.084,"row_group":"hangzhou-ermo-2504-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bffd9b09ff8e5181981d69c1313695473b7fd0d8a8b0a905a42b64ee61b83a43.png","width":207,"height":267,"width_mm":24.178,"row_group":"hangzhou-ermo-2504-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）实验时，仅有量程为20 cm的毫米刻度尺，利用摆长约100 cm的单摆测当地重力加速度，下列做法最合理的是（填空）。A. 摆球自然下垂，分段多次测量得到摆长且测量周期；B. 摆线对折多次后测量得到摆长且测量周期；C. 取两次摆长差为20 cm且尽可能长的摆长分别测量周期。\n\n14-Ⅲ.（5分）小张用多用电表粗略测得导体棒电阻约为"},{"type":"math","value":"10\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，为更精确地测量其电阻，他用实验室提供的下列器材再次进行测量：待测导体棒"},{"type":"math","value":"R_1"},{"type":"text","value":"；电压表V（量程为0～15 V，内阻约为"},{"type":"math","value":"20\\,\\mathrm{k}\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）；电流表"},{"type":"math","value":"A_1"},{"type":"text","value":"（量程为0～0.6 A，内阻约为"},{"type":"math","value":"0.2\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）；电流表"},{"type":"math","value":"A_2"},{"type":"text","value":"（量程为0～1.0 A，内阻约为"},{"type":"math","value":"0.1\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）；电流表"},{"type":"math","value":"A_3"},{"type":"text","value":"（量程为0～6.0 A，内阻约为"},{"type":"math","value":"0.05\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）；滑动变阻器"},{"type":"math","value"